i time which i enjoy  seeing the samurai plan to stop these  two flying six members from reaching  luffy which is honorable and respectable  but alas  they don't really stand a chance if they  go for luffy in their dino zone  transformations they'll  make it through the samurai with no  issue luffy recognizes them and then we  get what i've been waiting for  sanji finally spotted ulti and with red  cheeks he says  who's that cutie next to the dinosaur  from the flower capital  of course sanji would be all over this  dino cutie  and i really look forward to how that  dynamic will develop moving forward the  two dino people have no intention of  letting luffy near kaido again  but then our boy usop comes to rescue  along with nami  and they not only come in clutch with  the lizard repellent smoke  they also bring comedy and usefulness  with them they distract ulti  and page 1 and make it easier for luffy  to reach his goal of getting to kaido as  soon as possible  when you distract the toby ropo that's  useful because enough opponents like  that could significantly slow luffy down  so the fact that nami and usop  distracted them despite the fact that  they're probably scared and not  expecting to beat flying six members is  a significant win  as ulti is wondering who hit her  precious paypay  she looks to nami looking stoic and  pretty badass while usopp hides behind  her after launching the attack  nami is not too happy with usopp hiding  behind her but she knows the drill by  now  she says the fight has begun here we go  and of course  just as it seems like nami might stand  and fight she uses the joestar family  secret technique  which involves running away as she runs  for her life with a worried expression  on her face  she says bring it on and usopp mentions  what we're all thinking how her words  don't match her actions at all  again we get the humor among the crew  and the characters we love  and we also have oda having fun with the  conventions of cool anime 